<title>USA: Calif. Public Works $32 mln revs priced by Goldman.</title>
<headline>Calif. Public Works $32 mln revs priced by Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said it tentatively priced $32 million of State Public Works Board of the State of California energy efficiency revenue bonds, Series 1996A, with a top yield of 5.65 percent in 2012.</p>
